  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NDC Partnership is a international partnership aiming to help turn countries&#x2019; climate targets under the Paris Agreement, known as Nationally Determined Contributions (NDCs), into specific strategies and measures. It also aims to achieve greater harmonisation among the various donor programmes supporting NDCs.</narrative>
